title: Backwash
text: Not all light travels away from its laser.
trick: blue joins the red beam at a splitter on a loop and flows back along red's whole path, through two reflectors, into the magenta target at the red laser's muzzle; the same loop turns the splitter's light south
motif: open field
proof: not proved; no other solution found in 300 s
expect: merges>=1, reversals>=1
